        "id": 12496,
        "name": "Readinguselessmessages",
        "username": "Readinguselessmessag",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/r/7ea924/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2015-02-28T15:46:57.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I<span>s there a plan for Tactics to go digital sometime in the future? &nbsp;</span><span>I know Handelabra has their hands full with fully adapting all of the expansion deck into the digital version of Sentinels, but a digital Tactics seems like the next logical step. &nbsp;Also it would be perfect fit for many of us who already have too many non-digital games taking up space in our basements and cupboards.</span></p><p><span>Another thought, a Tactics-style digital game that infuses the storyline from the comic books may be an ideal way to introduce new gamers to the franchise. &nbsp;Money for &gt;Games, and more fun for us!</span></p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:44:03.307Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
        "quote_count": 0,
        "incoming_link_count": 1,
