        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>I<span style=\"font-size: 13px; line-height: 20px;\">s there a plan for Tactics to go digital sometime in the future? &nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">I know Handelabra has their hands full with fully adapting all of the expansion deck into the digital version of Sentinels, but a digital Tactics seems like the next logical step. &nbsp;Also it would be perfect fit for many of us who already have too many non-digital games taking up space in our basements and cupboards.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">Another thought, a Tactics-style digital game that infuses the storyline from the comic books may be an ideal way to introduce new gamers to the franchise. &nbsp;Money for &gt;Games, and more fun for us!</span></p>",
