        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ronway/{size}/1856_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-02-28T15:58:16.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Handelabra has stated they would like to make a digital version of it. However, I think they are focused on getting SotM to where they want it in terms of features and what have you. Plus the more work the put into SotM, the better the initial release of Tactics will be.</p>",
