        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/benhimself/{size}/2160_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-02-28T18:24:45.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Another thing is that SOTM works fine as a solo game but they'd really need to get multiplayer up and running before they did Tactics. I mean, yeah, you can hotseat it, but that's not really ideal.</p>",
