        "created_at": "2015-02-28T19:26:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Indeed. &nbsp;They'd have to develop some AI for the opposite side if they wanted to make Tactics into a singleplayer digital game. &nbsp;In Sentinels, the villains and environments are automatic, no decisions involved. &nbsp;It's different.</p><p>For the record, I do hope they convert Tactics once they're properly finished with the digital card game.</p>",
